            </div>
            <div class="why-choose-item-content">
                <h3>Visa Application Requirements</h3>
                <p>Learn about the supporting documents and application requirements relevant to your intended travel.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Item 3 -->
        <div class="why-choose-item wow fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="0.4s">
            <div class="icon-box">
                <img src="/images/icon-why-choose-3.svg" alt="">
            </div>
            <div class="why-choose-item-content">
                <h3>Application Procedures</h3>
                <p>Understand the visa application process, submission procedures and important travel considerations.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Item 4 -->
        <div class="why-choose-item wow fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="0.6s">
